message: Please cite the preprint and its replay supplement. The manuscript text is licensed under CC-BY-4.0; the replay program and the remaining files are licensed under Apache-2.0.
title: 'Replay supplement for Certified cubic and general-dimensional strong-coupling ceilings for electronic pair correlations in the Holstein model'
authors:
  - family-names: Rens
    given-names: Davis
    affiliation: SuperMatics Inc.
    orcid: 'https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5839-5197'
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.24417315
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-11-21
license: Apache-2.0
abstract: >-
  The tagged release tree of the preprint "Certified cubic and general-dimensional
  strong-coupling ceilings for electronic pair correlations in the Holstein model": the
  reviewed manuscript source, the released PDF and a standalone, standard-library
  certificate program that recomputes every finite arithmetic witness in exact rational and
  outward-interval arithmetic, with guarded mutant tests.
